      <p>  <p>The integer constant PRIM_GLTF_BASE_COLOR has the value 48</p>
  <p>Used to get or set the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/GLTF_Overrides" target="_blank">GLTF</a> base color override of an object's <b>face</b>.</p>
</p>
